<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xml:lang="eng">
  <head>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:fontFamily="Helvetica" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="bottomCenter" tts:origin="10% 78%" tts:extent="80% 18%" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body region="bottomCenter" style="s1">
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00:05.000" end="00:00:10.500">EN: Mara: Start the verification run at this marker.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:05.000.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:13.250" end="00:00:18.750">EN: Jules: Copy. Sidecar load is the only thing I am watching.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:13.250.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:21.500" end="00:00:27.000">EN: Mara: Keep the subtitle line fixed on screen for this pass.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:21.500.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:29.750" end="00:00:35.250">EN: Jules: Understood. No position changes in this variant.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:29.750.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:38.000" end="00:00:43.500">EN: Mara: If this renders, movement may be the real variable.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:38.000.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:46.250" end="00:00:51.750">EN: Jules: Logging the result against test nine.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:46.250.</p>
      <p begin="00:01:44.000" end="00:01:45.900">EN: Mara: Final picture cue for sidecar derived static.<br/>Clock reads 00:01:44.000.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
